sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Controller
    participant M as Model
    participant R as Radio loop
    R->>C: intermittent PDR, noise floor normal, tracks range
    C->>M: observation
    M-->>C: fading vs spot jamming, run spectrum_scan
    C->>R: spectrum_scan
    R-->>C: no excess energy on any channel
    C->>M: updated observation
    M-->>C: spot jamming unlikely, run mobility_test or reroute
    C->>R: move 30 m or reroute via closer peer
    R-->>C: link recovers with position change
    C->>M: updated observation
    M-->>C: fading confirmed, set_tx_power up or reroute, no hop
    Note over C,R: declared_jamming is false, no false positive
